                            <comment id="12898339" author="ssc" created="Fri, 13 Aug 2010 17:49:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I had used a stupid custom Partitioner, simply switching to HashPartitioner did the trick.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12898385" author="srowen" created="Fri, 13 Aug 2010 19:34:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;OK I even removed that partitioner class since it&apos;s now just a HashPartitioner&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
